<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.13 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.66 vs   1.88</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.77 vs   2.01</p>
<p> Sales		   11.22 vs  10.45</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.73 vs   2.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.95 vs   3.65</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.18 vs   3.87</p>
<p> Sales		   24.25 vs  19.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
